  "details": "Simply would like to request VRChat considers the release of usernames that have not logged in for a period of time and have under a certain amount of gameplay time. \nFor example: release the username of any user who has under 24 hours in game and has not logged in one year.\nIn today's age on vrchat it is difficult to find usable usernames I feel it would be beneficial to release usernames that are no longer in use.\nThis is a common practice among many long standing online games with limited name pools.",
